sequenceDiagram
    participant PlatformOp as Platform Operator<br/>(rhods-operator)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant ModuleOp as feast-module-operator<br/>(Go Operator)
    participant Kustomize as Kustomize Renderer<br/>(in-process)
    participant UpstreamOp as Upstream Feast Operator<br/>(Deployed Artifact)

    Note over PlatformOp,UpstreamOp: Flow 1: Module Operator Reconciliation

    PlatformOp->>K8sAPI: Create FeastOperator CR (singleton)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    K8sAPI-->>ModuleOp: Watch event: FeastOperator CR created
    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: Read FeastOperator CR spec<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: Read odh-feastoperator-config ConfigMap<br/>(platform version, platform name)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    ModuleOp->>Kustomize: Render manifests<br/>(select ODH/RHOAI overlay,<br/>substitute image refs from params.env)
    Kustomize-->>ModuleOp: Rendered manifests<br/>(Deployment, CRDs, RBAC, Services)
    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: Apply rendered manifests<br/>(create/update Deployment, CRDs, RBAC)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    K8sAPI-->>UpstreamOp: Deployment created/updated

    Note over PlatformOp,UpstreamOp: Flow 2: Platform Version Handshake

    PlatformOp->>K8sAPI: Write platformVersion to<br/>odh-feastoperator-config ConfigMap<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: Read platformVersion from ConfigMap<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    ModuleOp->>ModuleOp: Execute version-specific migrations<br/>(if any)
    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: Update FeastOperator CR<br/>status.releases (ack version)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token

    Note over PlatformOp,UpstreamOp: Flow 3: Metrics Collection

    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS

    Prom->>ModuleOp: GET /metrics<br/>Port: 8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (SA)
    ModuleOp-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
